IV. RESULTS AND DISCUSSION
To explore the influences of driving feedback on driving behaviour and experience in the two scenarios, data analysis results are presented separately. Firstly, the results in Scenario 1 are presented, which include the subjective assessment of driving experience and the objective assessment of driving behaviours. Then, the results of Scenario 2 are presented, where the driving behaviours in DLC and slalom manoeuvres are presented separately. Finally, the comparative analysis between Scenario 1 and 2 are presented, where the driving performance and experience are qualitatively discussed.
In addition, most of the results are shown in the form of boxplots. The cyan-coloured square points in boxplot figures are the mean values of the dataset, where the blue line shows the trend of the mean value; the bottom and top edges of the box indicate the 25th and 75th percentiles; the central mark in red indicates the median value; the red marker “+” represents the detected outliers.

